Subject: [PATCH 1/2] claude/skills/patch-triage: Compose the report's From and
 Message-ID
To: Pat Maddox <pat@patmaddox.com>
Cc: lab-devel@p7x.dev
Change-Id: xvpooqkortszryosslzzomwmwrlumtop
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 02:40:41 +0000

The skill said the delivery agent stamps the From, but
maildir-deliver.sh keeps the From as composed and adds no Message-ID.
A report written to the letter reached the list unattributed, and
without a Message-ID notmuch synthesizes one, so Pat's reply threads
under an id that no other copy of the report shares.
