index 14fe51c..1ffd737 100644
--- a/.claude/skills/patch-triage/SKILL.md
+++ b/.claude/skills/patch-triage/SKILL.md
@@ -133,8 +133,11 @@ be posted for real.
 
 The report is a standalone message, not a reply. Compose it as plain
 text wrapped at 72, subject `[TRIAGE] Patch queue <YYYY-MM-DD>`,
-addressed to Pat, and pipe it through the delivery agent, which stamps
-your From:
+addressed to Pat. Give it a From with your address, since the delivery
+agent keeps the From as composed, and a Message-ID, so replies to the
+report thread under it, e.g.
+`Message-ID: <$(date +%s).$(openssl rand -hex 6)@p7x.dev>`. Then pipe
+it through the delivery agent:
 
     libexec/mail/maildir-deliver.sh -i pat@patmaddox.com < /tmp/triage.eml
 
